  {
   "id": 666545,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Which functions can access <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">num</code>?\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">def print_double():\n&nbsp;&nbsp;num_d = num * 2\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print(num, \"doubled is\", num_d)\n\ndef print_square():\n&nbsp;&nbsp;num_sq = num * num\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print(num, \"squared is\", num_sq)\n\nnum = float(input())\nprint_double()\nprint_square()\n</pre>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328688,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print_double()</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "num can be accessed in print_double() and other functions."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328689,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print_square()</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "num can be accessed in print_square() and other functions."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328690,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print_double()</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print_square()</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">num</code> is global and can be accessed anywhere in the program, including both <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print_double()</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print_square()</code>."
    }
   ],
